          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Tighter US export controls provoke Chinese countermeasures and stepped-up naval/maritime security operations (including escorting, interdictions, and shadowing) and increase proxy harassment around regional chokepoints, directly raising the likelihood of shipping incidents and transit interruptions." />
